red_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"skJ1w8B5YusIibyxH4ohxQ","review_id":"S0fYmAnclnMKUpKUzhr0vg","date":"2014-05-28T03:49:37","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9465956091880798,"text_excerpt":"I had a blast with two friends here the other day. The fun even pulled the three of us slightly out of our hangover lull we were feeling. Had a few good rounds of bowling in very comfy and nicely decorated surroundings. We all ordered some small plates and the food was very good. I had the small tacos which were pretty awesome. One of the bartenders was really nice and the server coming to our table was just as nice. Plans to return are already in the works!"},{"business_id":"skJ1w8B5YusIibyxH4ohxQ","review_id":"t9RFd4vTXOSlikbwkxrMNA","date":"2021-09-21T03:07:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9430877566337585,"text_excerpt":"This place is totally a vibe. I made an online reservation for 6:45 pm because there were no slots for 7. The host let me push my reservation to 7 to better accommodate my late friends. I really like the atmosphere here. It's probably the most upscale bowling alley I've gone to. There are TVs and music. We were able to catch the LSU game while we bowled. It is more expensive, but you're paying for the vibes. Their drink menu is cool, I ordered a paloma. (It wasn't prepared correctly, but it was still okay.) The cheese fries were good. Our server wasn't giving happy to be a work energy, but everyone else was cool."},{"business_id":"skJ1w8B5YusIibyxH4ohxQ","review_id":"vycEocPd9tQ8FOINxUz_pg","date":"2017-12-09T17:02:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9390068054199219,"text_excerpt":"Let me preface this with I've only been here for events that were closed to the public so of course my experience would be different. Each event had different food so I think it's awesome that they offer such a wide variety when catering. Mostly finger foods but a few pasta dishes and a cheese/fruit/meat tray. Something for everyone. The drinks were great also. Each event, if I remember correctly, had a signature drink. All were creative and crafted quickly. There are also two bars which made a world of difference. Plus the staff takes care of you while you're playing so that's a no brain-er. The venue itself is very cool. Yes it's a bowling alley but they have other game options incase y..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"skJ1w8B5YusIibyxH4ohxQ","photo_id":"T35ARW-irxI9oN3Q_4FF_Q","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/T35ARW-irxI9oN3Q_4FF_Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8430708646774292},{"business_id":"skJ1w8B5YusIibyxH4ohxQ","photo_id":"I8HUFplrmDXYtJ2LRt_9ig","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/I8HUFplrmDXYtJ2LRt_9ig.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8377227783203125},{"business_id":"skJ1w8B5YusIibyxH4ohxQ","photo_id":"3NqjSpMSITGhrkHPREmIrg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/3NqjSpMSITGhrkHPREmIrg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8128807544708252},{"business_id":"skJ1w8B5YusIibyxH4ohxQ","photo_id":"EG4RxmsJmAnUjmBm2rnEPw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/EG4RxmsJmAnUjmBm2rnEPw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7997522354125977},{"business_id":"skJ1w8B5YusIibyxH4ohxQ","photo_id":"Kq_mdEOEhKg4J8Dwm6SN3w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Kq_mdEOEhKg4J8Dwm6SN3w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.6738921403884888}]},"notebook_case":null}
